# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for .NET 8.0 / ASP.NET Core solution
# Project: FraTool.sln (FraTool.Web, DuncanTool.Api, 11 class libraries)
# =============================================================================
# Framework: .NET 8.0
# IDE: Visual Studio 2022
# OS: Windows
# Front-end: Bootstrap, jQuery, Select2, Summernote, SweetAlert2, etc. (wwwroot)
# Back-end: SQL Server (connection strings in appsettings.json)
# APIs: Swashbuckle (Swagger), AspNetCore.Reporting, System.Drawing.Common
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT - Sensitive configuration files detected in this project:
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The following source-controlled files contain SQL Server credentials (usernames
# and passwords in plaintext) and should be sanitized before committing:
#   - FraTool.Web/appsettings.json
#   - DuncanTool.Api/appsettings.json
#   - FraTool.Web/Properties/launchSettings.json
#   - DuncanTool.Api/Properties/launchSettings.json
#
# Recommended: Replace real credentials with placeholders and use .NET user-secrets
#   or environment variables for local development:
#     dotnet user-secrets init
#     dotnet user-secrets set "ConnectionStrings:DefaultConnection" "..."
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

